(ii) The applicant shall surrender her passport to the Trial/Special Court before Bail Bonds are accepted, and shall not leave the country without prior permission of the concerned Court;
(iii) The petitioner shall furnish the complete address, where she shall ordinarily reside, to the I.O. as well as the concerned Court, and in case of change of same, she shall intimate the same to the I.O. and the Court immediately;
